{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":501947,"name":"Chris Oh","username":"chrisoh806","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/c/ccd318/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-27T08:25:21.085Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501947-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501947-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501947-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501947-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot stuck on “Updating Grok Bot’s Computer”. Been stuck on this window for a while at “Transferring your data” at 43% and cannot get past it, even with restarts. I had this same problem a week ago and a support ticket was the only thing that got it to clear out.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501947-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501947-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eProblem persists whenever Grok Bot is open.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501947-expected-behavior-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501947-expected-behavior-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eExpected Behavior\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot is unusable while “Updating Grok Bot’s Computer” dialog is active.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-501947-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-501947-screenshots-screen-recordings-5\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://us1.discourse-cdn.com/cursor1/original/3X/2/d/2d26fa0765db13bac644cae53154a695dbe2d4